msgid "Deals fire damage with a potency of 250 to target and all enemies nearby it.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Ninki Gauge Cost:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 50<br>Shares a recast timer with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Bhavacakra</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
