msgid "Instantly restores own HP.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 200<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Eyes Open</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Shares a recast timer with <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Hissatsu: Seigan</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
