msgid "Deals unaspected damage with a potency of 130 to all enemies in a cone before you.<br><if ($gn68 == 35)><if ($gn72 >= 68)><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Grants a <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Mana Stack</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br></if></if><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Balance Gauge Cost:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Black Mana</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Balance Gauge Cost:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 20 <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>White Mana</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar.<br>※<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Moulinet</ui-edge-color></ui-color> changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Enchanted Moulinet</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when requirements for execution are met."
