msgid "Gradually restores own MP and the MP of all nearby party members.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Halves enmity"
