msgid "Reduces damage taken by 50% and counters up to the next 5 attacks.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Counter Potency:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 1,200<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 6s<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Counter Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> Increases <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Kenki Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 5<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Kenki Gauge Cost: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>25"
